    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A suspense horror adventure novel where the story branches based on your choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are having an online drinking party with your friends. It was supposed to be an ordinary day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you witness a creepy woman holding a knife appear in your friend\u2019s room through the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friend, who has returned to the room, seems unaware of the impending danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will you warn your friend and save them from the threat?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose actions and conversations to aim for an ending where your friend is rescued.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, new mysteries will emerge that you will want to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to solve the problems and read all the stories to complete all the endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192100/extras/446cd2fe0e3ee5f73cf690da561df8e4.avif?t=1729669990\" width=800 height=630 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the mouse to advance the text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the mouse to select options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192100/extras/45c4ac645b7b11bac3c49d9169554c98.avif?t=1729669990\" width=800 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After reaching one ending, start the game from the beginning or from a certain point to choose different options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192100/extras/b5bb8ee013b889956c125e3fa3406952.avif?t=1729669990\" width=800 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can skip the text of previously read parts by pressing the skip button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A suspense horror adventure novel where the story branches based on your choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are having an online drinking party with your friends. It was supposed to be an ordinary day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you witness a creepy woman holding a knife appear in your friend\u2019s room through the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friend, who has returned to the room, seems unaware of the impending danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will you warn your friend and save them from the threat?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose actions and conversations to aim for an ending where your friend is rescued.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, new mysteries will emerge that you will want to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to solve the problems and read all the stories to complete all the endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192100/extras/446cd2fe0e3ee5f73cf690da561df8e4.avif?t=1729669990\" width=800 height=630 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the mouse to advance the text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the mouse to select options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192100/extras/45c4ac645b7b11bac3c49d9169554c98.avif?t=1729669990\" width=800 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After reaching one ending, start the game from the beginning or from a certain point to choose different options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192100/extras/b5bb8ee013b889956c125e3fa3406952.avif?t=1729669990\" width=800 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can skip the text of previously read parts by pressing the skip button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
